Courtade–Kumar Conjecture — Lean 4 formalization

This project formalizes the Courtade–Kumar theorem in:
Hessam Mahdavifar and Ahmad Beirami.
The Most Informative Bit and Beyond: A Proof of the Courtade–Kumar
Conjecture and Multibit Extensions. arXiv:2609.26444, 2026.
https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.26444

The files in MostInformativeBit/Vendor/GeneralCK/ are adapted from
dpwoodru/general-courtade-kumar-lean:
https://github.com/dpwoodru/general-courtade-kumar-lean
